    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Nope it's not linked. It's because the Helper is written in cjs (the [error](https://rollupjs.org/guide/en/#error-name-is-not-exported-by-module) come from Rollup). To avoid the error without any Rollup configuration use:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nimport algoliasearchHelper from 'algoliasearch-helper';\r\n\r\n// ...\r\n\r\nnew algoliasearchHelper.SearchParameters()\r\n```",
    "commit_id": "880b7bd13f7964cf1cc9d9774d011ddfb5d97d03",
